var dir="Assets/BlightBloom/Art/Architecture/CrookedMortar/BotanicalPlanterKit01";var sd="ArtSource/Blender/Architecture/CrookedMortar/BotanicalPlanterKit01";var scene=UnityEngine.SceneManagement.SceneManager.GetActiveScene();if(!scene.path.Contains("CM_BotanicalPlanterKit01"))throw new System.Exception("Require own botanical review");AssetDatabase.Refresh();var catalog=Newtonsoft.Json.Linq.JArray.Parse(System.IO.File.ReadAllText(sd+"/ModuleCatalog.json"));var prefabs=new System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary<string,GameObject>();var mats=new System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary<string,Material>();foreach(var k in new[]{"FoliageDry","Foliage","Timber","Clay","Soil","Twine"})mats[k]=AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<Material>(dir+"/Materials/CM_Botanical01_"+k+".mat");
foreach(var j in catalog){var name=(string)j["name"];var root=new GameObject(name);var lods=new System.Collections.Generic.List<LOD>();int i=0;foreach(var l in j["lods"]){var go=(GameObject)PrefabUtility.InstantiatePrefab(AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<GameObject>(dir+"/Models/"+(string)l["file"]),scene);go.name="LOD"+i;go.transform.SetParent(root.transform,false);foreach(var r in go.GetComponentsInChildren<MeshRenderer>()){string materialName=r.sharedMaterials[0].name;var key=mats.Keys.OrderByDescending(k=>k.Length).First(k=>materialName.Contains("_"+k));r.sharedMaterials=Enumerable.Repeat(mats[key],r.sharedMaterials.Length).ToArray();if(i>0)r.shadowCastingMode=UnityEngine.Rendering.ShadowCastingMode.Off;}lods.Add(new LOD(i==0?.025f:.0065f,go.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>()));i++;}if(lods.Count>1){var group=root.AddComponent<LODGroup>();group.SetLODs(lods.ToArray());group.RecalculateBounds();}var sockets=new GameObject("Connections");sockets.transform.SetParent(root.transform,false);foreach(var sock in j["sockets"]){var p=sock["position"].ToObject<float[]>();var go=new GameObject((string)sock["name"]);go.transform.SetParent(sockets.transform,false);go.transform.localPosition=new Vector3(p[0],p[1],p[2]);}prefabs[name.Replace("CM_BotanicalPlanterKit01_","")]=PrefabUtility.SaveAsPrefabAsset(root,dir+"/Prefabs/"+name+".prefab");UnityEngine.Object.DestroyImmediate(root);}
AssetDatabase.SaveAssets();UnityEditor.SceneManagement.EditorSceneManager.SaveScene(scene);return "Updated own component prefabs; shared stem/leaf draw material";
